# Classical Theory, Postmodernism, and the Sociology Liberal Arts Curriculum.

**Authors:** Lembcke, Jerry Lee

## Abstract
Discusses classical theory as a modernist endeavor to apprehend the phenomenon of &quot;unity of disunity.&quot; Presents three ways that classical theory approaches the philosophy views of Durkheim, Marx, and Weber. Concludes that postmodernism validates the relevancy of classical theory. (CFR)

